---
import '../styles/global.css';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f2eee4" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="description" content="Graceful Intelligence. Thoughtful AI applications for people who value truth and trust." />
    <title>Graceful Intelligence — Built on trust.</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${base}/favicon.svg`} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="canvas">
      <header class="header">
        <a class="wordmark" href={`${base}/`} aria-label="Graceful Intelligence home">
          <svg class="brand-mark" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 7a10 10 0 1 0 1 13v-6h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="24" cy="5" r="1.7" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          <span>graceful<span class="wordmark-secondary">intelligence</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="nav-contact" href="#contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </header>

      <main id="main">
        <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="headline">
          <span class="hero-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
          <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Human values. Artificial intelligence.</p>
          <h1 id="headline">Intelligence,<br />with <em>integrity.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">We’re building AI apps for everyday life.<br class="desktop-break" /> Your trust matters to us.</p>
          <div id="contact" class="contact">
            <button class="contact-button" type="button">Contact us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
            <noscript><p class="contact-note">Enable JavaScript to open an email to us.</p></noscript>
          </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="our-thesis" aria-labelledby="thesis-heading">
          <h2 id="thesis-heading">Our Thesis</h2>
          <div class="thesis-copy">
            <p>AI can help people understand their health, learn something unfamiliar, or get through a difficult task. But it can also give a wrong answer with confidence. When software asks for our trust, we need to understand what it knows, where it might be wrong, and what happens to the information we share.</p>
            <p>We started Graceful Intelligence because we believe this deserves more care. We want to build apps that bring the capabilities of AI into everyday life, with the person using them at the center of decisions. A health app, for example, should help you understand a pattern while being honest about what that pattern can tell you.</p>
            <p>We are still working out how to earn that trust. Our starting point is to explain things plainly, acknowledge uncertainty, and give people control over their information and choices. We intend to hold ourselves to those principles as we build, and to listen when we fall short.</p>
            <p>Graceful is the feeling we hope our software gives you: enough clarity to know where you stand, and enough confidence to look up and consider what comes next. We want to make things that deserve a place in your life. That takes care, every day.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="footer">
        <p>© {year} Graceful Intelligence</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
    <script>
      const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button.contact-button');
      button?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        // Decode only on interaction; keep the address out of the HTML and string literals.
        const recipient = [52, 33, 50, 48, 54, 53, 38, 63, 58, 61, 39, 54, 63, 63, 58, 52, 54, 61, 48, 54, 19, 60, 38, 39, 63, 60, 60, 56, 125, 48, 60, 62]
          .map(value => String.fromCharCode(value ^ 83)).join('');
        window.location.href = `mailto:${recipient}`;
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
